<section class="environment-visual" aria-labelledby="environment-visual-title">
  <div class="environment-visual-head"><span aria-hidden="true">⌁</span><div><p class="eyebrow">From use to environment</p><h2 id="environment-visual-title">Three pathways worth separating</h2></div></div>
  <div class="environment-paths">
    <article><svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 51c3-17 13-27 28-27 12 0 20 6 24 17"/><path d="M10 59c8-5 17-5 25 0m10 0c8-5 17-5 25 0M21 18c9-9 22-10 33 0"/><circle cx="40" cy="40" r="9"/></svg><h3>Air</h3><p>Some volatile ingredients enter air during use. Their role in ozone or particle formation depends on the compound and local atmospheric conditions.</p></article>
    <article><svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 42c12-10 25-10 37 0s19 10 25 0M13 55c12-10 25-10 37 0s19 10 25 0"/><path d="M34 20c0 8-10 13-10 22a16 16 0 0 0 32 0c0-9-10-14-10-22"/></svg><h3>Water</h3><p>Some fragrance chemicals have been detected in wastewater and aquatic environments; removal and persistence vary by substance and treatment system.</p></article>
    <article><svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M40 67V39M40 50C20 49 17 34 18 21c15 2 23 12 22 29m0 8c20-2 24-17 22-30-14 3-21 13-22 30"/><path d="M12 67h56"/></svg><h3>Lifecycle</h3><p>Raw materials, energy, packaging and disposal all matter. “Natural” and “synthetic” alone do not describe a product’s total impact.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .environment-visual{margin:0 0 28px;padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;background:#f7fbf8}.environment-visual-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px}.environment-visual-head>span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:#dcece5;color:#3d7769;font-size:24px}.environment-visual h2{margin:3px 0 0;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25}.environment-paths{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:18px}.environment-paths article{padding:13px;border:1px solid #dbe9e1;border-radius:14px;background:#fff}.environment-paths svg{display:block;width:52px;height:52px;margin-bottom:7px;fill:#dcece5;stroke:#47776a;stroke-width:3;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.environment-paths h3{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:15px}.environment-paths p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}@media(max-width:620px){.environment-visual{padding:17px}.environment-visual h2{font-size:20px}.environment-paths{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}.environment-paths article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:58px 1fr;column-gap:10px}.environment-paths svg{width:48px;height:48px;grid-row:span 2}.environment-paths h3{align-self:end}.environment-paths p{grid-column:2}}
